29.390">Out </span><span begin="00:29.390" end="00:29.810">of </span><span begin="00:29.810" end="00:30.530">control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.530" end="00:32.270"><span begin="00:30.530" end="00:30.530">（</span><span begin="00:30.530" end="00:30.740">Go</span><span begin="00:30.740" end="00:30.770">） </span><span begin="00:30.770" end="00:31.130">Where </span><span begin="00:31.130" end="00:31.400">should </span><span begin="00:31.400" end="00:31.610">I </span><span begin="00:31.610" end="00:32.270">go</span><span begin="00:32.270" end="00:32.270">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.270" end="00:34.130"><span begin="00:32.270" end="00:32.270">（</span><span begin="00:32.270" end="00:32.330">Do</span><span begin="00:32.330" end="00:32.360">） </span><span begin="00:32.360" end="00:32.660">What </span><span begin="00:32.660" end="00:32.930">should </span><span begin="00:32.930" end="00:33.140">I </span><span begin="00:33.140" end="00:34.100">do</span><span begin="00:34.100" end="00:34.130">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.130" end="00:36.920"><span begin="00:34.130" end="00:34.280">I </span><span begin="00:34.280" end="00:34.640">don't </span><span begin="00:34.640" end="00:35.330">understand </span><span begin="00:35.330" end="00:35.540">what </span><span begin="00:35.540" end="00:35.690">you </span><span begin="00:35.690" end="00:36.080">want </span><span begin="00:36.080" end="00:36.260">from </span><span begin="00:36.260" end="00:36.920">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.950" end="00:38.270"><span begin="00:36.950" end="00:37.310">Cause </span><span begin="00:37.310" end="00:37.370">I </span><span begin="00:37.370" end="00:37.730">don't </span><span begin="00:37.730" end="00:38.270">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.360" end="00:40.160"><span begin="00:38.360" end="00:38.600">If </span><span begin="00:38.600" end="00:38.690">I </span><span begin="00:38.690" end="00:38.900">can </span><span begin="00:38.900" end="00:39.350">trust </span><span begin="00:39.350" end="00:40.160">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.220" end="00:43.280"><span begin="00:40.220" end="00:40.370">I </span><span begin="00:40.370" end="00:40.730">don't </span><span begin="00:40.730" end="00:41.390">understand </span><span begin="00:41.390" end="00:41.630">what </span><span begin="00:41.630" end="00:41.780">you </span><span begin="00:41.780" end="00:42.170">want </span><span begin="00:42.170" end="00:42.380">from </span><span begin="00:42.380" end="00:43.280">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.280" end="00:48.980"><span begin="00:46.280" end="00:46.430">I </span><span begin="00:46.430" end="00:46.760">feel </span><span begin="00:46.760" end="00:46.940">like </span><span begin="00:46.940" end="00:47.030">I'm </span><span begin="00:47.030" end="00:47.750">spinning </span><span begin="00:47.750" end="00:47.930">out </span><span begin="00:47.930" end="00:48.050">of </span><span begin="00:48.050" end="00:48.980">control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.070" end="00:52.340"><span begin="00:49.070" end="00:49.400">Try </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:49.490">to </span><span begin="00:49.490" end="00:49.970">focus </span><span begin="00:49.970" end="00:50.210">but </span><span begin="00:50.210" end="00:51.050">everything's </span><span begin="00:51.050" end="00:52.340">twisted</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.400" end="00:55.670"><span begin="00:52.400" end="00:52.700">And </span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:53.030">all </span><span begin="00:53.030" end="00:53.660">alone </span><span begin="00:53.660" end="00:53.810">I </span><span begin="00:53.810" end="00:54.350">thought </span><span begin="00:54.350" end="00:54.500">you </span><span begin="00:54.500" end="00:54.680">would </span><span begin="00:54.680" end="00:55.280">be </span><span begin="00:55.280" end="00:55.670">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.670" end="00:58.370"><span begin="00:55.670" end="0